        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Hi René,</div><div><br></div><div>I hope you are doing well. Apologies for the delayed response.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for reaching out. We sincerely appreciate having you as a valued client and would be more than happy to continue supporting your team's research in 2025.</div><div><br></div><div>The cost of renewing your subscription license under the same conditions remains CAD 4,407.12 (~ USD 3,190.68). If you could kindly confirm this, I will ask our finance team to issue and send the invoice in USD.</div><div><br></div><div>We'd also love your feedback on our platform and hear about your research plans for next year. Are you available for a chat sometime after October 23rd? Our calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">, feel free to choose a time that is most convenient for you.</span>\n</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much. Have a great weekend!</div><div>Best,</div><div>Sara</div><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div><div>\n<br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Wednesday, October 16, 2024 at 1:08:28 PM, R Finger wrote:<br><br><div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hello,</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">We would like to continue our Ethica license in 2025, under the same conditions as this year.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Could you please send me a quote for the license in 2025.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"