        "body": "<div>Hi René,</div><div><br></div><div>I hope you had a great weekend.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for confirming this. We will issue your invoice and send it to you soon.</div><div><br></div><div>Currently, the following studies are attached to your license:</div><div><br></div><div>1650, 1830, 2252, 2261, 2265, 2366, 2406, 2466, 2492, 2517, 2704, 2705, 2706, 2707, 2862, 2995, 3231, 3233, 3303, 3345, 3514, 3519, 3579, 3641, 3666, 3715, 3731, 3732, 3754, 3772, 3773, 3852, 3864, 3875, 3891.</div><div><br></div><div>As of today, a total of 27,484 participants/week have been used, which is ~61.08% of the total quota.</div><div><br></div><div>If you have any further questions, please don't hesitate to reach out.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Sara</div><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div><div>\n<br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Monday, October 21, 2024 at 2:37:55 PM, R Finger wrote:<br><br><div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#1f497d;\">Hello Sara,</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\">The conditions you send are correct.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\">We would like to receive the quote for this in USD.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\">Could you also provide me with the amount we use from our license for 2024, until now.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\">Thank you.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\"> </span></p>\n<div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\">Best regards, </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\">René Finger</span></p>\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#f47321;\">R.G.G. Finger</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1f497d;\"></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\">Maastricht University</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\"><br>\n<br>\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\">Faculty of Psychology &amp; Neuroscience, Instrumentation &amp; Engineering<br> Universiteitssingel 40 East, room 3.750, 6229 ER Maastricht</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\"><br>\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\">P.O. Box 616, 6200MD Maastricht, The Netherlands</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\"><br>\n<br>\n</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\">T</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\"> (043) 38 84542 <b>F</b> (043) 38 84199<br>\n<b>E</b> <a href=\"mailto:r.finger@maastrichtuniversity.nl\"><span style=\"color:gray;\">r.finger@maastrichtuniversity.nl</span></a><b> </b></span></p>\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\"> </span></b></p>\n<p><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\">Available on Monday(H), Tuesday, Wednesday &amp; Thursday(H)</span></u></i></b><b><i><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\"></span></u></i></b></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:gray;\"> </span></p>\n<p><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#3333ff;\">Portfolio: </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#4f81bd;\"><a href=\"http://fpn-ie.maastrichtuniversity.nl/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">http://fpn-ie.maastrichtuniversity.nl</a></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#548dd4;\"></span></b></p>\n</div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><p><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> Sara Farnya &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt; <br>\n<b>Sent:</b> zaterdag 19 oktober 2024 04:15<br>\n<b>To:</b> sales@ethicadata.com; Finger, René (PSYCHOLOGY) &lt;r.finger@maastrichtuniversity.nl&gt;<br>\n<b>Cc:</b> amin.t@ethicadata.com<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> RE: Ethica license 2025</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<p>Hi René,</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>I hope you are doing well. Apologies for the delayed response.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you for reaching out. We sincerely appreciate having you as a valued client and would be more than happy to continue supporting your team's research in 2025.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>The cost of renewing your subscription license under the same conditions remains CAD 4,407.12 (~ USD 3,190.68). If you could kindly confirm this, I will ask our finance team to issue and send the invoice in USD.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>We'd also love your feedback on our platform and hear about your research plans for next year. Are you available for a chat sometime after October 23rd? Our calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, feel free to choose a time that is most convenient for you. </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you very much. Have a great weekend!</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Best,</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Sara</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>--<br> Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:sales@avicennaresearch.com\">sales@avicennaresearch.com</a> - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br> --</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<di